  "statement": "# Pixel Sabotage — task brief\n\nThis is a design target, not an implementation specification. Build your own GDD, scene structure, rules, and code.\n\n## Target player experience\n\nSneak through a patrolled facility, use the virus and keycard to unlock successive doors, and complete the sabotage without being detected.\n\n## Scope boundary\n\nA single-level 3D stealth infiltration with camera-relative movement, crouch-based silent traversal, aimed interactions, patrol hazards, sequential locks, failure, and terminal completion.\n\n## Creative freedom\n\nYou may choose the facility layout, patrol routes, cover geometry, objective presentation, and visual treatment while preserving the seven-step objective order.\n"
